Hi, 

Welcome to the CoolBox site!

Here we have a set of libraries written in CPP which have a set of extensions to enable usage with some (or a subset) of the features offered in the original library.

 
We offer (or attempt to offer) the application in as many different package distributions as possible, currently we build for these targets;

𖧼 Windows
༎ຶ OSX
ಥ Linux

We offer the following language extensions, keeping mind that that these are not full sets.

இRust
ຈPython
𓎱JavaScript
⦾Go
⊙Java
𓁿C
𓁽R

